# Z-Index Rules (full doc: docs/z-index.md)

## Standard Scale

| Value | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `-z-10` | Background elements |
| `z-10` | Sticky/relative overlays |
| `z-30` | Floating buttons (scrolled) |
| `z-40` | Fixed navigation, FAB, dialog overlay |
| `z-50` | Modals, dialogs, sheets, popovers |
| `z-60` | Modal controls (close buttons on lightboxes) |

## Rules

- Dialogs/modals: z-50 for content, z-40 for backdrop
- FAB and fixed nav: z-40
- Popovers/dropdowns: z-50
- NEVER use arbitrary values like `z-[999]` or `z-[100]`
- Always assign z-index to fixed/absolute/sticky elements

For full component reference and code examples: read docs/z-index.md
